grh-ch1-body : List Word
grh-ch1-body =
  grh-ln "  <p>Why does aggressively compacting a <code>17.4M</code>-line Lean 4 proof with tactic golfing still plateau at <strong><code>76,000</code> lines of code</strong> (<code>113,000</code> total lines across <code>792</code> files: <code>573</code> in <code>src/Lib</code> and <code>219</code> in <code>src/New</code>) sitting atop <strong><code>~1,800,000</code> lines of pinned <code>Mathlib</code></strong> and three classical axioms (<code>propext</code>, <code>Classical.choice</code>, <code>Quot.sound</code>)?</p>" (
  grh-ln "  <p>Because tactic compaction optimizes <em>surface token length inside an unfactored representation</em>. In <code>lsernau/grh-lean</code>, commutative-ring cancellations, Hermitian lattice rank identities, Harder&ndash;Narasimhan slope convexities, Kudla seesaw trace identities, and Landau pole windows are re-proved element-by-element across Dedekind/Cauchy reals (<code>&Ropf;</code>), Bochner measure spaces, and quotient-erased <code>Prop</code> terms that cannot compute.</p>" (
  grh-ln "  <div class='tbl-wrap'>" (
  grh-ln "    <table>" (
  grh-ln "      <thead><tr><th>Formalization Corpus</th><th>Source Size</th><th>Dependency Cone &amp; Axioms</th><th>Kernel Check</th><th>Ratio vs. 17.4M</th></tr></thead>" (
  grh-ln "      <tbody>" (
  grh-ln "        <tr><td><strong>Alp&ouml;ge + Claude</strong> (Nov 20, 2026, Lean 4.33.1)</td><td><code>17,400,000</code> L<br><span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:12px'>175,187 files &middot; 1,455,012 decls</span></td><td><code>Mathlib</code> + <code>propext</code>, <code>Classical.choice</code>, <code>Quot.sound</code></td><td>Multi-hour (4-kernel shard)</td><td><code>1.0&times;</code></td></tr>" (
  grh-ln "        <tr><td><strong>Masullo / McCorvie</strong> (<code>riemann-masullo</code>, Nov 20, 2026)</td><td><code>~141,000</code> L<br><span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:12px'>17,640 thms + 940-pp. PDF</span></td><td><code>Mathlib</code> &middot; <span class='warn-badge'>14 LAYER-5 SORRIES</span></td><td>~45 min</td><td><code>123&times;</code></td></tr>" (
  grh-ln "        <tr><td><strong>Sernau / Anthropic <code>grh/</code></strong> (Nov 25, 2026 readable)</td><td><code>~300,000</code> L</td><td><code>~1,800,000</code> L <code>Mathlib</code> (<code>56a00585</code>) + 3 classical axioms</td><td><code>1&ndash;2 hr</code> (12c, 24 GB)</td><td><code>58&times;</code></td></tr>" (
  grh-ln "        <tr><td><strong>Sernau / Anthropic <code>grh-compact/</code></strong> (smallest external)</td><td><code>113,000</code> L<br><span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:12px'><code>76,000</code> LOC &middot; 792 files</span></td><td><code>~1,800,000</code> L <code>Mathlib</code> + 3 classical axioms</td><td><code>1&ndash;2 hr</code> (64 GB Comparator)</td><td><code>154&times;</code> (<code>229&times;</code> LOC)</td></tr>" (
  grh-ln "        <tr class='hl-row'><td><strong>Hyperactivity Full 7-Module Stack</strong> (<code>lib/math/*</code>)</td><td><strong><code>1,917</code> L</strong><br><span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:12px'><code>93,609 B</code> across 7 modules</span></td><td><span class='ok-badge'>0 MATHLIB &middot; 0 AXIOMS &middot; 0 FLOATS</span></td><td><strong><code>7.0 s</code></strong> (1 core)</td><td><strong><code>9,077&times;</code></strong> (<strong><code>39.6&times;</code></strong> vs. 76k)</td></tr>" (
  grh-ln "        <tr class='hl-row'><td><strong>Hyperactivity Unified GRH Spine</strong> (<code>grh-atlas</code>)</td><td><strong><code>601</code> L</strong><br><span style='color:var(--muted);font-size:12px'><code>32,076 B</code> + SV RTL + C11</span></td><td><span class='pink-badge'>0 POSTULATES &middot; REFL NORMAL FORM</span></td><td><strong><code>7.0 s</code></strong> (1 core)</td><td><strong><code>28,951&times;</code></strong> (<strong><code>126.5&times;</code></strong> vs. 76k)</td></tr>" (
  grh-ln "      </tbody>" (
  grh-ln "    </table>" (
  grh-ln "  </div>" (
  grh-ln "  <div class='scale-bars' aria-label='Logarithmic proof volume comparison'>" (
  grh-ln "    <div style='margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--pink);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.07em;font-size:11px'>Log<sub>10</sub> Formalization Footprint (Source + Dependency Cone)</div>" (
  grh-ln "    <div class='sb-row'><span>Alp&ouml;ge + Claude (raw)</span><div class='sb-track'><div class='sb-fill' style='width:100%'></div></div><span>17,400,000 L</span></div>" (
  grh-ln "    <div class='sb-row'><span>grh-compact + Mathlib cone</span><div class='sb-track'><div class='sb-fill' style='width:86.5%'></div></div><span>~1,913,000 L</span></div>" (
